# Campaign output. Every phase writes here, nothing here is committed.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/.gitkeep
!artifacts/**/.gitkeep
# The Track U harnesses are hand-written C and Go. build_all.sh compiles
# each one in place, and that output is not committed.
harnesses/*/build/
state/*
!state/.gitkeep
# knowledge/ itself is committed on purpose. It is the only thing that
# survives a rebuilt box. Its lock files are not committed.
knowledge/*.lock
__pycache__/
*.pyc
thoughts/
# The v0.8.1 change record is an internal working document: it analyses
# defects in the pipeline's own tooling and records what a change wave
# landed. The repository states the resulting design in docs/ and in the
# phase prompts, so a reader needs neither the analysis nor its history.
improvement_v0.8.1.md
tmp/
.claude/settings.local.json
# The documentation site's build output and toolchain. package.json and
# package-lock.json are committed; CI installs from the lockfile.
docs/node_modules/
docs/dist/
docs/.astro/
